target: internal/ledger/pins.go
verify: go test ./internal/ledger/ -count=1 -run 'TestCitationsReadsEveryPin'
expect: --- FAIL:
why:    with no path on the left and no length floor any hex-looking word makes a pin shape, so prose such as [price @ 100] or [user@fade] lands in broken_pins as a pin to fix
--- old
	spaceClass + `]*[0-9A-Fa-f]{6,})[` + spaceClass + `]*\]`)
--- new
	spaceClass + `]*[0-9A-Fa-f]+)[` + spaceClass + `]*\]`)
